WEBVTT

0
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:04.460
Sprezzature is an AI engine for Design.

1
00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:06.580
This one is about charts.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.500
You have a spreadsheet,
and no idea which chart to draw.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.920
So you make the same bar chart
as last time.

4
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:24.600
Here, you have 168 kinds of chart
to choose from.

5
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:29.160
Flows, networks, distributions,
maps, and many more.

6
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.337
Each one is drawn by hand,
line by line, as a real vector file.

7
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:43.400
The text stays text. You can select it,
search it, and hear it read aloud.

8
00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:48.480
The secret: every kind says
what data it needs.

9
00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:53.725
So your columns do the choosing,
and nothing is left to guesswork.

10
00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:58.920
And the result reads like a page,
not like a screenshot.

11
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.200
Star it on GitHub,
and find the suite on sprezzature.ai.

12
00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:14.360
Make it, audit it, take a look at it.
